    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "35 Patrick Street, Portarlington\r\n\r\nA Charming two-bedroom, two-storey semi-detached home, conveniently located within a couple of minutes walking distance of Portarlington town centre which hosts an abundance of shops and transport facilities, schools, leisure centre & swimming pool, train station and many fine dining facilities! \r\nThe accomodation comprises of a fitted kitchen with adjoining diningroom and a separate lounge. Up stairs there are two well appointed bedrooms and a bathroom with wc & shower, some aesthetic updates would turn this home into an awesome modern living space! \r\nA side entrance leads to a large rear garden which is overgrown but offers excellent potential for landscaping and for those with ‘green fingers’. The property also benefits from a stand alone garage & workshop. \r\nIdeal for first time buyers and those who want to downsize!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Two bedroom town house, with bathroom wc and shower on the first floor.\r\nThree seperate living spaces on the ground floor, sitting room, dining-room /living-room and fitted kitchen. \r\n\r\nLarge garage /workshop and substantially sized rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A traditional town house with character and lots and lots of potential.\r\n\r\nTwo comfortable bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThree seperate living spaces downstairs, Kitchen, Living Room & Dining Room .\r\n\r\nLarge rear garden offering a blank canvas for keen gardeners.\r\n\r\nValuable side entrance with independant access to the garden.\r\n\r\nSeperate garage, ideal for storage, a workshopor hobby space.\r\n\r\nOil fired centeral heating.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Portarlington town centre.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to renovate and create a home in your own style.\r\n\r\nA manageable first home with room to grow. \r\n\r\nA house that needs some attention, but could reward the right buyerhandsomely."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
